# Fab Haus — Architecture & Fabrication Landing Page

Build specification for a static, single-page website for **Fab Haus**, an architecture firm that also fabricates and manufactures. Page layout and interaction style follow the structure of https://www.rakinteriors.com/ (layout only). Colors, fonts, content rules and everything else in this spec are unchanged.

