## 13. Deferred: SEO (later phase)

SEO is intentionally **not** part of the mock build. It is recorded here so it is not forgotten:
- Page title, meta description, Open Graph/social image, canonical URL, sitemap, `robots.txt`, structured data (organization / local business), heading and image alt/filename review.
- Analytics and click tracking on contact and portfolio links.
- Rendering: the Phase 1 stack is a client-rendered React single-page app, which gives crawlers little HTML. Decide on prerendering or static generation before this phase, because it changes the build setup.
- `noindex` is removed only as part of the go-live steps in section 12.